It doesn't matter

4
00:01:11,696 --> 00:01:14,449
whether you're male, female,

5
00:01:14,532 --> 00:01:18,286
Muslim, Christian, Catholic,
Jewish. It doesn't matter.

6
00:01:18,495 --> 00:01:20,830
If you're a Maiden fan,
you're an Iron Maiden fan.

7
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:22,332
You're part
of one fucking world

8
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:23,958
and one family, my friends.

9
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:25,085
CROWD: (CHEERING)

10
