00:59:00,745 --> 00:59:02,038
BRUCE: We wrote, recorded,
released,

1140
00:59:02,247 --> 00:59:05,291
and toured five albums
in six years.

1141
00:59:05,375 --> 00:59:09,712
It just kept getting bigger
