1142
00:59:09,879 --> 00:59:12,215
It was the world's biggest
roller coaster.

1143
00:59:22,016 --> 00:59:23,351
(CAMERA SHUTTERS CLICKING)

1144
00:59:23,476 --> 00:59:25,895
BRUCE: It just took us to new
heights round the world.

1145
00:59:27,605 --> 00:59:29,399
But we were working ourselves
to the bone.

1146
00:59:31,901 --> 00:59:34,237
You get on the treadmill
of tour,

1147
00:59:34,320 --> 00:59:36,781
album, tour, more touring.

1148
00:59:36,864 --> 00:59:40,243
(CAMERA SHUTTERS CLICKING)

1149
00:59:40,410 --> 00:59:41,828
MAN: I took one look
at the band

1150
00:59:41,995 --> 00:59:44,080
and my first thought was,

1151
00:59:44,289 --> 00:59:47,500
"They look tired.
They look stressed."

1152
00:59:50,795 --> 00:59:52,755
The concerts were great,
you know? People were great,

1153
00:59:52,880 --> 00:59:55,758
but everything else
was horrible.

1154
00:59:55,842 --> 00:59:57,552
