1155
00:59:57,719 --> 00:59:59,721
It wasn't just a 13-month tour.

1156
00:59:59,804 --> 01:00:01,723
It was the ten-month tour
before that

1157
01:00:01,764 --> 01:00:03,433
and it was the eight-month tour
