1158
01:00:03,600 --> 01:00:06,894
So cumulatively,
it was five years.

1159
01:00:07,103 --> 01:00:09,022
Five years of the golden cage.

1160
01:00:13,151 --> 01:00:14,569
PHIL RODRIGUEZ: You can tell
they had the mileage,

1161
01:00:14,777 --> 01:00:15,945
that they'd put in the hours.

1162
01:00:18,364 --> 01:00:21,951
And Iron Maiden at the beginning
were just brutal tours.

1163
01:00:23,578 --> 01:00:24,621
Everyone was fried.

1164
01:00:25,747 --> 01:00:27,373
